HEADS AAA

START     *** SETUP0    *** SSS
SETUP0    *** SETUP1    *** SDD
SETUP1    *** SETUP2    *** SSD
SETUP2    *** TOP_HI    +** RRR

TOP_HI    *.* TOP_LO    +++ RRR
TOP_HI    *@* TOP_HI    +** RRR
TOP_HI    ___ TURN1     *** SSS
TOP_LO    *.* TOP_HI    +++ RRR
TOP_LO    *@* TOP_LO    **+ RRR
TOP_LO    ___ TURN1     *** SSS

TURN1     *** TURN1a    *** SSS
TURN1a    *** TURN1b    *** LLS
TURN1b    *** TURN1c    *** DDS
TURN1c    *** TURN1d    *** LLL
TURN1d    *** TURN1e    *** LSS
TURN1e    *** RIGHT_OUT *** DSS

RIGHT_IN  *.* RIGHT_OUT +++ DDD
RIGHT_IN  *@* RIGHT_IN  +** DDD
RIGHT_IN  ___ TURN2     *** SSS
RIGHT_OUT *.* RIGHT_IN  +++ DDD
RIGHT_OUT *@* RIGHT_OUT **+ DDD
RIGHT_OUT ___ TURN2     *** SSS

TURN2     *** TURN2a    *** SSS
TURN2a    *** TURN2b    *** UUU
TURN2b    *** TURN2c    *** UUL
TURN2c    *** TURN2d    *** ULL
TURN2d    *** BOT_LO    *** SSS

BOT_HI    *.* BOT_LO    +++ LLL
BOT_HI    *@* BOT_HI    +** LLL
BOT_HI    ___ TURN3     *** SSS
BOT_LO    *.* BOT_HI    +++ LLL
BOT_LO    *@* BOT_LO    **+ LLL
BOT_LO    ___ TURN3     *** SSS

TURN3     *** TURN3a    *** SSS
TURN3a    *** TURN3b    *** RRR
TURN3b    *** TURN3c    *** RRU
TURN3c    *** TURN3d    *** RUU
TURN3d    *** LEFT_IN   *** SSS

LEFT_IN   *.* LEFT_OUT  +++ UUU
LEFT_IN   *@* LEFT_IN   **+ UUU
LEFT_IN   +++ STOP      *** SSS

LEFT_OUT  *.* LEFT_IN   +++ UUU
LEFT_OUT  *@* LEFT_OUT  +** UUU
LEFT_OUT  +++ STOP      *** SSS
